                    Fred^{sa}
                    \\;\simeq\;
                    Fred_+^{sa}(\mathscr{H}_{\mathbb{R}})
                    \\,\sqcup\,
                    Fred_-^{sa}(\mathscr{H}_{\mathbb{R}})
                    \\,\sqcup\,
                    Fred_\ast^{sa}(\mathscr{H}_{\mathbb{R}})
