          %h4#SummaryInTermsOfGradedFredholmOperators In terms of graded Fredholm operators
          %p
            Equivalently, the classifying spaces for topological K-theory in its various degrees (including those contractible components) are those of graded self-adjoint complex Fredholm operators (Rem.
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TheSpaceOfGradedFredholmOperators"}
            %em
              %a{:href => "Wigner+theorem#PCTQuantumSymmetries"} PCT quantum symmetries
            from this list:
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
